  "source_text": "Hecks.bluebook \"MarlowFinch\" do\n  vision \"The Marlow & Finch studio site: posts, pages, pictures and their schedule.\"\n\n  aggregate \"Desk\" do\n    description \"A desk in the newsroom.\"\n    identified_by :name\n\n    value_object \"DeskName\" do\n      attribute :value, String\n    end\n\n    attribute :name, DeskName\n\n    command \"OpenDesk\" do\n      role \"Admin\"\n      goal \"Open a desk\"\n      attribute :name, DeskName\n      emits \"DeskOpened\"\n    end\n  end\nend\n"
